  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "* Added IRestExceptionMapper, to map additional exception types, registered through AddRestExceptions(options => options.AddMapper<T>()).\n* Added RestExceptionFactory, to create a RestException from an HttpStatusCode.\n* Exceptions mapped to 5xx are now logged, since .NET 10 no longer logs exceptions handled by an IExceptionHandler.\n* Fixed a crash when a RestException's extensions contained a \"method\" or \"requestId\" key.\n* Fixed the default message of FailedDependencyRestException.\n* Included XML documentation in the package.\n* Breaking: InvalidOperationException is now mapped to 500 Internal Server Error, instead of 405 Method Not Allowed.\n* Breaking: StringExtensions.ToKebabCase is now internal.",
